#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_liabilities
msgid ""
"In the exceptional case where disclosure of all or part of the required "
"information would cause serious harm to the entity in a dispute with a third"
" party concerning the matter to which a liability relates, that information "
"is not provided. In that case, the general nature of the dispute, the fact "
"that the information has not been disclosed, and the reason why it has not "
"been disclosed are stated."
msgstr ""
"Dans le cas exceptionnel où la divulgation de tout ou partie des "
"informations requises causerait un préjudice grave à l’entité dans un litige "
"avec un tiers concernant l’objet d’un passif, ces informations ne sont pas "
"fournies. Dans ce cas, la nature générale du litige, le fait que les "
"informations n’ont pas été communiquées et les raisons de cette omission "
"sont indiqués."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_liabilities
msgid ""
"In the exceptional case where disclosure of all or part of the required "
"information would cause serious harm to the entity in a dispute with a third"
" party concerning the matter to which the provision or contingent liability "
"relates, that information is not provided. In that case, the general nature "
"of the dispute, the fact that the information has not been disclosed, and "
