#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_other_information
msgid ""
"Since allowances are allocated for multi-year allocation periods and then "
"issued to companies in annual tranches, entities must show under "
"\"Commitments received\" the portion of allowances remaining to be received "
"for the current allocation period."
msgstr ""
"Les quotas étant attribués pour des périodes pluriannuelles puis délivrés "
"aux entreprises par tranches annuelles, les entités doivent faire figurer "
"sous « Engagements reçus » la part des quotas restant à recevoir pour la "
"période d’attribution en cours."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_accounting_policies
