#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_other_information
msgid ""
"The entity may disclose the following information relating to professional "
"training:"
msgstr ""
"L’entité peut fournir les informations suivantes relatives à la formation "
"professionnelle :"

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_other_information
msgid ""
"The entity that transfers the servicing of the debt discloses, at the time "
"the transaction is carried out, its financial consequences and its overall "
"cost. Until the debt is legally extinguished, it provides information on the"
" transaction, in particular the amount remaining to be repaid included in "
"financial commitments."
msgstr ""
"L’entité qui transfère le service de la dette indique, lors de la "
"réalisation de l’opération, ses conséquences financières et son coût global. "
"Jusqu’à l’extinction juridique de la dette, elle fournit des informations "
"sur l’opération, notamment le montant restant à rembourser inclus dans les "
"engagements financiers."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_cash_flow_statement
msgid ""
"The financing table is prepared based on the cash flows relating to "
"operating, investing and financing activities for the year (where "
"applicable, specify the adjustments made and the definition of net cash "
"used)."
msgstr ""
"Le tableau de financement est établi à partir des flux de trésorerie liés "
"aux activités opérationnelles, d’investissement et de financement de "
"l’exercice (le cas échéant, précisez les retraitements effectués et la "
"définition de la trésorerie nette retenue)."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_cash_flow_statement
