"The gross value of goods and supplies includes the purchase price and "
"incidental expenses."
msgstr ""
"La valeur brute des marchandises et approvisionnements comprend le prix "
"d’achat et les frais accessoires."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_taxation
msgid ""
"The impact on the result for the year of any tax change enacted between the "
"balance sheet date and the date the accounts are prepared is disclosed."
msgstr ""
"L’incidence sur le résultat de l’exercice de toute modification fiscale "
"adoptée entre la clôture et la date d’établissement des comptes est indiquée."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_headcount
msgid ""
"The information required under Article 837-1 is broken down by category."
msgstr ""
"Les informations requises à l’article 837-1 sont ventilées par catégorie."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_off_balance_sheet
msgid ""
"The information required under the preceding paragraphs, as well as that "
"required under Article 836-3, is broken down according to the balance sheet "
"items to which the relevant assets would have related; the information "
"required under the last paragraph is broken down by maturity: within one "
"year, more than one year and up to five years, and more than five years."
msgstr ""
"Les informations requises aux paragraphes précédents ainsi qu’à l’article "
"836-3 sont ventilées selon les postes du bilan auxquels les actifs concernés "
"auraient été rattachés ; les informations requises au dernier paragraphe "
"sont ventilées par échéance : à un an au plus, à plus d’un an et cinq ans au "
"plus et à plus de cinq ans."

