#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_liabilities
msgid ""
"The notes include a statement of the maturity of payables at the closing of "
"the year. Payables are classified according to the time remaining until "
"maturity, distinguishing between payables due within one year, payables due "
"in more than one year and up to five years, and payables due in more than "
"five years."
msgstr ""
"L’annexe comporte un état des échéances des dettes à la clôture de "
"l’exercice. Les dettes sont classées selon leur durée restant à courir "
"jusqu’à l’échéance, en distinguant les dettes à un an au plus, à plus d’un "
"an et cinq ans au plus, et à plus de cinq ans."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_assets
msgid ""
"The notes include a statement of the maturity of receivables at the closing "
"of the year. Receivables are classified according to the time remaining "
"until maturity, distinguishing between receivables due within one year and "
"receivables due in more than one year."
msgstr ""
"L’annexe comporte un état des échéances des créances à la clôture de "
"l’exercice. Les créances sont classées selon leur durée restant à courir "
"jusqu’à l’échéance, en distinguant les créances à un an au plus et à plus "
"d’un an."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_assets
msgid ""
"The notes include a table of subsidiaries and investments required by "
"Article L. 233-15 of the French Commercial Code, according to the following "
"model."
msgstr ""
"L’annexe comporte le tableau des filiales et participations prévu à "
"l’article L. 233-15 du Code de commerce, selon le modèle suivant."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_liabilities
msgid "The notes include an indication of debts secured by collateral."
msgstr "L’annexe indique les dettes garanties par des sûretés."

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_assets
