#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes
msgid ""
"These notes supplement and comment on the information given by the balance sheet and the income statement of {{ company name }} for the financial year ended {{ end of period }}, covering a period of 12 months.\n"
"                <br>The total balance sheet for the year before appropriation of the result is {{ total balance sheet }}.\n"
"                <br>The net accounting result is {{ net accounting result }}."
msgstr ""
"La présente annexe complète et commente les informations figurant au bilan "
"et au compte de résultat de {{ company name }} pour l’exercice clos le {{ "
"end of period }}, d’une durée de 12 mois.\n"
"                <br>Le total du bilan de l’exercice avant affectation du "
"résultat s’élève à {{ total balance sheet }}.\n"
"                <br>Le résultat comptable net est de {{ net accounting "
