"la nature des droits et obligations transférés ou à transférer :"

#. module: l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:l10n_fr_reports_accountant_knowledge.l10n_fr_accountant_knowledge_article_template_notes_accounting_policies
msgid ""
"decomposable assets: the company has not been able to identify decomposable "
